title: "Boyue: Decision Boundaries and Complexity Governance for AI-Assisted Software Engineering"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Wuaishare"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-08-27
url: "https://github.com/wuaishare/boyue"
